STR_GRF_NAME                                                    :Example Stations v0.2
STR_GRF_DESCRIPTION                                             :{ORANGE}Example Stations{}{BLACK}This is a simple example GRF with some templated station platforms.

STR_VERSION_22723                                               :1.2.0 (r22723)

STR_PARAM_DISABLE_UNLOCK_YEAR_NAME                              :Disable station introduction dates
STR_PARAM_DISABLE_UNLOCK_YEAR_DESCRIPTION                       :Toggle whether all station types are available regardless of the in-game year.

STR_PARAM_SET_CARGO_THRESHOLD_NAME                              :Waiting cargo threshold
STR_PARAM_SET_CARGO_THRESHOLD_DESCRIPTION                       :What quantity of passengers must be waiting at the station before they are shown on the platforms.
STR_PARAM_SET_CARGO_THRESHOLD_1                                 :Low (Recommended)
STR_PARAM_SET_CARGO_THRESHOLD_2                                 :Medium
STR_PARAM_SET_CARGO_THRESHOLD_3                                 :High
STR_PARAM_SET_CARGO_THRESHOLD_4                                 :Very High


