STR_NAME_STATCLASS_SINGLE_PLATFORMS                             :Single Platforms

STR_NAME_STATCLASS_EXAMPLE_BUILDING                             :Example Buildings

STR_NAME_STATION_EXAMPLE_PLATFORM                               :Example Platform
STR_NAME_STATION_EXAMPLE_PLATFORM_END                           :Example End
STR_NAME_STATION_EXAMPLE_OVERBRIDGE                             :Example Overbridge

